{"seq":12,"slug":"technical-interviewer","title":"技术面试官","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 技术面试官 简介\n\n技术面试是人才选拔的关键环节，而一个优秀的技术面试官不仅需要扎实的技术功底，更需要系统的面试方法论和评估框架。面试质量直接影响团队的人才密度和工程文化，然而许多工程师在转型为面试官时缺乏专业训练。本知识库系统介绍技术面试的全流程方法与实践，帮助你成为一名专业、公正且高效的技术面试官。\n\n本知识库适合承担面试职责的中高级工程师、技术管理者以及希望提升招聘效果的团队负责人。无论你是刚开始参与面试，还是已经有丰富的面试经验但希望优化流程和方法，都能从中获得实用的指导。\n\n第1章**面试设计**从面试流程的整体架构入手，讲解面试环节的设计、题库的构建方法、评分标准的制定以及面试小组的组织方式，帮助你建立科学、可复现的面试体系。\n\n第2章**技术评估**深入各类技术考察方式，涵盖编码面试的设计与评判、系统设计面试的引导方法、代码评审式评估以及带回作业的设计原则，帮助你全面准确地评估候选人的技术能力。\n\n第3章**行为面试**聚焦非技术维度的考察，介绍 STAR 方法的应用、文化匹配度的评估、识别候选人风险信号的技巧以及多元化与包容性的面试实践。\n\n第4章**录用决策**讲解从面试评估到最终决策的完整流程，涵盖决策框架的设计、偏见消除的方法、Offer 谈判策略以及从面试到入职的交接衔接。\n\n建议学习路径：先从第1章建立面试设计的系统认知，再根据你的面试职责选择第2章或第3章深入，第4章的决策框架适合参与录用决策的面试官重点学习。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interview-design","title":"面试设计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/interview-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interview-process","title":"面试流程设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/interview-design/interview-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"question-bank-design","title":"题库设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/interview-design/question-bank-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scoring-rubric","title":"评分标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/interview-design/scoring-rubric"},{"seq":4,"slug":"interview-panel","title":"面试委员会","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/interview-design/interview-panel"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technical-assessment","title":"技术评估","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/technical-assessment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"coding-interview","title":"编码面试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/technical-assessment/coding-interview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-design-interview","title":"系统设计面试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/technical-assessment/system-design-interview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-review-assessment","title":"代码审查评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/technical-assessment/code-review-assessment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"take-home-assignment","title":"Take-Home 编程作业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/technical-assessment/take-home-assignment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"behavioral-interview","title":"行为面试","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/behavioral-interview","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"star-method","title":"STAR 方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/behavioral-interview/star-method"},{"seq":2,"slug":"culture-fit","title":"文化契合度评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/behavioral-interview/culture-fit"},{"seq":3,"slug":"red-flags","title":"识别危险信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/behavioral-interview/red-flags"},{"seq":4,"slug":"diversity-inclusion","title":"多元化与包容性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/behavioral-interview/diversity-inclusion"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"hiring-decision","title":"录用决策","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/hiring-decision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decision-framework","title":"决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/hiring-decision/decision-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bias-mitigation","title":"偏见消除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/hiring-decision/bias-mitigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"offer-negotiation","title":"Offer 谈判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/hiring-decision/offer-negotiation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"onboarding-handoff","title":"入职交接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-interviewer/hiring-decision/onboarding-handoff"}]}]}